</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
retention rate and churn rate for our active users are calculated as follows:</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="background-color: white">
    <td rowspan="2" style="width: 20%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Retention rate of active
    users for any quarter</span></td>
    <td rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">=</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; width: 75%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Existing
    active users</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="background-color: white">
    <td style="text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total active users in the
    past quarter</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="background-color: white">
    <td rowspan="2" style="width: 20%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Churn rate of active
    users for any quarter</span></td>
    <td rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">=</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; width: 75%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total
