<ix:footnote id="ix_5_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Accrued professional fees
The balance of accrued professional fees represented amount due to third parties service providers which include marketing consulting service, IT related professional service, audit fee, tax filing fee, and consulting fee related to capital raising.</ix:footnote><!--Text not found in footnote sections assigned to Schedule of Other Payables and Accrued Liabilities-->
<ix:footnote id="ix_6_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Accrued promotion expense
The balance of accrued promotion expense represented the balance of profit sharing payable to the Company&#8217;s merchant and subscribed agents to promote business growth.</ix:footnote><!--Text not found in footnote sections assigned to Schedule of Other Payables and Accrued Liabilities-->
<ix:footnote id="ix_7_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Accrued interest
The balance of accrued interest represented the balance of interest payable from convertible notes aforementioned in Note 9.</ix:footnote><!--Text not found in footnote sections assigned to Schedule of Other Payables and Accrued Liabilities-->
<ix:footnote id="ix_8_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Payables to merchants from ZCITY platform
The balance of payables to merchants from ZCITY platform represented the amount the Company collected on behalf of merchant from its customer through the Company&#8217;s ZCITY platform.</ix:footnote><!--Text not found in footnote sections assigned to Schedule of Other Payables and Accrued Liabilities-->
